# Gmail credentials for email verification
# Replace with your actual Gmail address and app password
GMAIL_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
GMAIL_PASS=your-gmail-app-password

# Google Cloud credentials for backups
# Replace with path to your service account key JSON file
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=path/to/service-account-key.json

# Instructions:
# 1. Enable 2-factor authentication on your Gmail account
# 2. Generate an App Password: https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/185833
# 3. Replace the values above with your Gmail and app password
# 4. For Google Cloud: Create a service account at https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts
# 5. Enable Google Drive API and Google Sheets API for your project
# 6. Download the service account key JSON and set the path above
# 7. Restart the server after updating